  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The number of elements in the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8484;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is _______ .&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Now using above formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8484;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}